2. The following offences may be compounded by the Board or any officer of the Board authorised in that behalf by the Board in accordance with section 32 of the Act:
(a)any offence under the Housing and Development (Animals) Rules 2024 (G.N. No. S 684/2024);
(b)any offence under the Housing and Development (Common Property and Open Spaces) Rules (R 3);
(c)any offence under the Housing and Development (Renovation Control) Rules (R 15);
(d)any offence under the Housing and Development (Animals) Rules (R 4) as in force immediately before 1 September 2024.
